        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B60WKF, Single Cylinder Wakefield Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wakefield Single Cylinder Deadbolt comes in an array of beautiful finishes. It is suited to fit doors 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The oval shape is perfect for traditional homes; and this Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Wakefield Trim is a great way to add classic elegance to any home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Oval Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Wakefield Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8” or 2-3/4”</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8” x 2-3/4”, 1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wakefield Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Schlage B60WKF",
                "description": "Schlage B60WKF, Wakefield Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The Wakefield Single Cylinder Deadbolt comes in an array of beautiful finishes. It is suited to fit doors 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The oval shape is perfect for traditional homes; and this Single Cylinder Deadbolt with Wakefield Trim is a great way to add classic elegance to any home.\r\n",
